17t10 42 07z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state close branch fix otelgin data race main chang 83 10 across 2 file label mileston this pr fix an exist bug not introduc new safeti mechan i respect disagre with the character that this pr introduc mechan for concurr safeti the opposit is true this pr remov problemat code that caus a data race the current code ha a real reproduc race condit report in issu 4588 open for 2 year the race detector fail consist this is not theoret it violat go s memori model sourc id src pr 07 pull request otelgin remov unneed context save restor to avoid data race open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 8014 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 8014 author nicksherron creat 2025 10 14t04 01 24z updat 2025 10 17t10 42 07z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state close branch fix otelgin data race main chang 83 10 across 2 file\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"074c61ea8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"id\": \"09feab0883dcf7bb\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3878215545906416, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.18533683512948806, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8602859, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"074c61ea8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8014.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 33019, \"chunk_count\": 21, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:11\", \"token_count\": 10517, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"*